# CoinMarketCap API Documentation

> CoinMarketCap is the most-referenced source of cryptocurrency market data: real-time and historical prices, market cap, OHLCV, exchange and on-chain DEX data, and CMC's proprietary indices (Fear & Greed, CMC100, CMC20, Altcoin Season).
>
> **No API key required to start.** Call the [Keyless Public API](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/keyless-public-api.md) with no key and no signup - just prefix any supported path with `/public-api`, e.g. `https://pro-api.coinmarketcap.com/public-api/v2/simple/price?symbol=BTC,ETH&convert=USD`. Add a free API key for higher rate limits and the full endpoint catalog.

