## API Reference — Market Data (Pro API)

- [Keyless Public API](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/keyless-public-api/): No-key access via `/public-api` — try Simple Price, listings, global metrics, indices, and selected DEX endpoints before signing up.
- [Cryptocurrency](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/cryptocurrency/): 19 endpoints — prices, market cap, volume, listings, quotes, trending, categories, and metadata.
- [Exchange](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/exchange/): 7 endpoints — exchange metadata, rankings, market pairs, volume data, and proof-of-reserves.
- [Real World Assets](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/real-world-assets/): 7 endpoints — tokenized equities, commodities, ETFs, and real estate (ID map, metadata, listings, quotes, market pairs, issuers).
- [Derivatives](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/derivatives/): 6 endpoints — derivatives exchanges, perp/futures market pairs, and latest liquidations (global, by exchange, by cryptocurrency).
- [CMC AI](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/cmc-ai/): 3 endpoints — homepage market feed, per-coin insights, and coverage map for Coin Detail Page AI content.
- [Global Metrics](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/global-metrics/): 6 endpoints — total market cap, BTC dominance, fear/greed index, and altcoin season index.
- [Content](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/content/): 4 endpoints — headlines, news, top posts, and comments.
- [Community](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/community/): 2 endpoints — trending topics and trending tokens.
- [CMC Index](https://coinmarketcap.com/api/documentation/pro-api-reference/cmc-index/): 4 endpoints — CMC 100 and CMC 20 index latest and historical.

